From 9cf831e5875fe0bcc7462b36206237e000649360 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Saqib Ansari <nextchamp.saqib@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 21:45:45 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 04/27] feat(desk): dashboard-view mounts the island a
 Dashboard claims (backport #41714)

An app claims a Dashboard in its onload handler with __onload.island. A Dashboard an island draws holds no charts, so charts is no longer required, and get_allowed_dashboards admits it on the document's own permission through get_list. A user who cannot read Dashboard gets no dashboards instead of a failed boot. A bare dashboard-view route opens the Dashboard list, since the page now draws only the document its route names. Widgets gain destroy(), so a redraw releases an island a widget holds.
